Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:54.24,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 呆瓜们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hurry it up, fishies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在毫无防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got our pants down out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就只有一打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only like a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 - 哈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I mean … - Huck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤掉托德维修站的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relieve Todd at the maintenance station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛拉 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Mara … - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:01:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It, uh, feels … - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去里面拿冷却器 开始打包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside. Get the coolers. Start packing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小罗伊 我是玛拉 收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Roy, it's Mara. You copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,J-Top 我是玛拉 收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}J-Top, it's Mara. You copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Todd?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁每一层楼梯井\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the stairwell, every floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎他们修了一道缓冲区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like?they made themselves a moat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不奇怪 考虑到之前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we shouldn't be surprised, considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到的 我们做到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this. We did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我就是考虑到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's what I was considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前没在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要视野清楚 对吗 戴安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need a clear shot. Right, Dianne?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,几秒钟就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需把握好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just need to time it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他们看到我们 开枪 我们就进不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see us, they fire a gun, we're not getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们开枪 戴安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them fire a gun, Dianne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 需要我们掩护你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, do you need us to cover you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮忙的 不该让你一个人上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're here to help. It shouldn't just be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸围过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damned are upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,先保护好你们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到他去哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone see where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他通风报信 那我们就没机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he tells them we're here, it's over before it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有机会 他不会报信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not, and he won't,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们会一起找到他 消灭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}for we together will find him, end him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后实现我们最初的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fulfill the promise of what we have begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要相信国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨站在正北方 穿过林子就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outpost is due north, through the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会往那边走 所以我们也跟过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As that's surely his course, so shall it be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我们的同志已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our comrades had already arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd have been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回集结区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to the staging area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等其他人到了就把大家集合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather the others when they land.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他们还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they haven't yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把希瓦从笼子里放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}release Shiva from her cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,正北方 我们会给你留下标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due north.?We'll leave a trail for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确保这附近没有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ensure no enemies remain in these environs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要落下超过10分钟 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be not 10 minutes behind. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲向敌人 冲向他的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}To our foe, then to his compound,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲向注定的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}then to certain victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开 盯住缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out! Watch for breaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,围着他们打 他们麻烦比我们大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep 'em locked in, they got bigger problems than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear the shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地待命 别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are. Do not say another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果枪在里面就给个信号 我们马上过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You signal?if they're already inside. We'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 把枪找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's find them guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪诺 帮我们开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dino, we need an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,找条路或者杀条路出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find one or make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}0.50勃朗宁重机枪 存放在谢泼德办公室广场\N房顶破损 楼顶无看守\N四层楼 白天通常没人 车辆20+\N进入楼梯 电梯井
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一层没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来只能上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only option is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,高点 好掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}High ground. Good cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 换我也会放上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd put them up there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们胆小 不敢逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're too chickenshit to move in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,反打回去 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We push them back! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,右前方有敌人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some coming up on my right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,压制他们 别让他们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on them! Don't let them through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,困住他们 自然都跑不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pin them in, it takes care of itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,按原计划来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定 掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take them! Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 跟托宾一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait for Tobin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 我帮你打掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! I'll help cover you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一层了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪一定藏在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guns have gotta be up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说枪在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said they'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前给你的情报都是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else he passed you is checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙就是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy's a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些枪被送到救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guns get to the Sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以突破行尸 辟出通路\N{\fnArial\fs30}they could cut through those walkers and free up an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.31,0:14:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行动更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go faster if we split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁找到M2重机枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find the M2s, ?you find 'em, we use them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接用它支援院子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit the courtyard right then and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点了结吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}End this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Please! Please don't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Please don't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看 你尿裤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, you pissed your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.67,0:15:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, m-my name's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稍等 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just wait.?- For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经投降了 塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his hands up, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去查看一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go check that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一队人生死不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're missing some people from the other team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在对攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on top of each other here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全之后 我们给你信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll signal you when it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解决 耶稣 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, Jesus. Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面正在战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a firefight outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连摩根是否活着都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if Morgan's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 女士 我不是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, lady. I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里 手里有枪 你是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here. You had a gun. You are one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我不是 你要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I'm not. You got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是一个劳工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我从救世堂带到这里做饭打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought me from the Sanctuary to cook, clean, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did not give me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逼我离开了妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made me leave my wife and kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也这么对救世堂里的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people do this to the Sanctuary, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The families okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想伤害劳工\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to hurt the workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会的 - 你相信他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not going to. - You believe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和他没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会朝一个已经举手投降的人开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna shoot someone with their hands up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会让你开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not letting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些药物补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}These medical supplies …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是山顶寨的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're the Hilltop's, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬的孕期维生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's prenatals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随心所欲地抢走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took them because they could,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么要在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know they killed your girlfriend…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶稣… - 深爱的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus … - …that you loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是这样的人 - 现在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't you. - ?It is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来复仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能变成那样 - 可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It can't be about that. - It can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,换我可不会开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有意思的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般我会求你大发慈悲 而不是求帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally I'd peg you as the softie, not pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道故意尿到裤子上有多难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how hard it is to piss yourself on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是你的老二知道你穿着裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like your dick knows you're wearing pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, look that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西是废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that shit is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子那个蠢婊子玛姬和她孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like that dumb bitch Maggie and her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,横竖都要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are just gonna die, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就跟你俩一样 - 我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like you two. - I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你杀不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, no, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也会有别人动手 我们有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then someone else will. There's too many of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我有不同看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's where we differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我带着你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I take the two of you with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就有了完美保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I've got one hell of an insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你何不放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you put that thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想射穿这个小帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you're gonna shoot through this beautiful man here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会问第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得她会开枪的 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think she's gonna shoot you. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 她会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔拉 - 我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara. - I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 他拿枪顶着我头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, he has a gun to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死吧 - 好 所以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to hell.?- Okay. So …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真想孤注一掷是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really wanna risk it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我危及他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以现在告诉你 我不值得你这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can tell you right now that I am not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能想法子和解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能说话爱逞威风装硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I may talk a big game like I'm a tough guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really just want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会下手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是复仇 而是完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about revenge. It's about getting it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你讲过了 这和他没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you … it's not about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he gets to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那亚伯拉罕呢 格伦呢 丹妮斯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Abraham? Glenn? Denise?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是两码事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是瑞克 你也不是玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Rick. You're not Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会听我讲我的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she'll hear what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离一号站 撤离一号站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evac Sat 1! Evac Sat 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣 塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're falling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的路能出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There another way out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托宾 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tobin! - I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们继续 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep going! I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.01,0:21:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们并不需要逼近我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't have to move in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么成这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What befell this creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说在你下手之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没时间纠结这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.24,0:22:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,离基地不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compound's not far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他抵达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he made it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.71,0:22:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们知道我们要来 他们就会有所准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they know we're coming, they're gonna be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.41,0:23:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两种可能 一个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two possibilities, just one fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们都要准备好应战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall be ready regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接下来要面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's about to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是几个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not just a few walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.85,0:23:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我依然在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. And yet I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心中充满了自信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I feel the supreme confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说我的命运 我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is my lot, my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我表现出这种确定性\N{\fnArial\fs30}to simply project such certainty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No and yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终二者都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then finally yes to both.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.41,0:23:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装能成 直到真成 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake it till you make it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这样做到的 也是我正在做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've done and what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以是国王 是因为我照亮了一束光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am King because?I-I have provided a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:23:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,引领我的人民穿过黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lead my people forward through the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我的想象成为了现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they have made my fictions realities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.53,0:24:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这一切和发生过的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, with all this and everything that's happened …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.29,0:24:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能都活不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us may not make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至可能赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may not even win.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.59,0:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不能畏惧失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no fantasies of failure this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.61,0:24:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这是行尸的血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Is this blood from the wasted?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.98,0:24:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚才交火时有人打中他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us hit him when we fired on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.65,0:24:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说他走得很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means he's moving slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.75,0:24:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hells yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.42,0:24:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续前进…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move forward…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.71,0:24:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,推动整个世界一起前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we move the very world forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.00,0:27:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些M2重机枪在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The M2s. Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里…没有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…Guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.63,0:27:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.89,0:27:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:27:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们能取胜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,能打败他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.79,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭我们做过的事 积累的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}What this group has done, what we've learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,学到的本领 齐心协力 我确定可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we've become, all of us … yes, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.98,0:29:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门围起来 包围圈大一点 至少六米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circle the door, wide, at least 20 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.02,0:29:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起枪 但不要开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns up, but hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.41,0:29:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会投降的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.58,0:29:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们先开火 我们再回击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only fire if they fire first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.42,0:29:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们先开火 我们会死人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fire first, one of us dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好祈祷 他们不开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's hope, for my sake, that they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以试试阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 立刻投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.90,0:30:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺想活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.53,0:30:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得我们蠢 你们别真犯蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be as dumb as they think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.77,0:30:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.77,0:30:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.27,0:30:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用麻烦的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为就算玛姬听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because even if Maggie listens to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克也会听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick will listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to come for them before they come for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生命的地方 就有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's life, there's possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他们攻击的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of them hitting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.96,0:31:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也被调过来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get transferred, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.18,0:31:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.73,0:31:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来杀他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came here to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.41,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.63,0:32:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们是哪种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do we do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.29,0:33:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}格雷西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.37,0:33:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.51,0:33:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.02,0:34:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,省点子弹 卡罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your munitions, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.39,0:34:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friends have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.11,0:35:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.88,0:36:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 但我们的人需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, but our people…they need…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.55,0:36:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.68,0:36:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.00,0:36:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 埃里克 埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Eric, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.89,0:36:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.30,0:36:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.18,0:37:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们注定的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there it is … our certain victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不因他的死而高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}This … I am not glad for his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或任何人的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}For anyone's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.52,0:37:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.03,0:37:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔逊 我们出动了 采取积极措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nelson, we're on the move, taking active measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.57,0:37:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来 止好血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hole up, keep it elevated,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.22,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到我们 记得避开枪火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you see us, stay out of the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.64,0:37:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现了 只能撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jig's up. Gonna have to break chocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.24,0:37:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.79,0:37:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段旅程不能以失败告终\N{\fnArial\fs30}This journey will not end in retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.42,0:37:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们知道我们要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they know we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.79,0:37:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确实知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.94,0:38:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.37,0:38:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,手别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.87,0:38:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.04,0:38:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.80,0:38:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫莫拉莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Morales.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}亚特兰大营地幸存者之一\N在第一季中没有选择前往疾控中心\N而是带家人去了伯明翰 后再无音讯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.83,0:39:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.70,0:39:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.56,0:39:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呼叫了救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called the Saviors back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.68,0:39:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在来的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're coming.
